        "Description": "This random passing Ninja absolutely hates saunas and the people who use them.\r\rThis ninja is very profesional, so no colatteral or cameras (but a bit of jank can just be brushed off as ninja magic).\r\rFor an extra challenge, this ninja was able to start with no items and pick up only 1 other than the Katana at the start.\r\rGood luck!",
